{"id":"n4-007","title":"Noun しか～ない","romaji":"Noun shika~nai","jlptLevel":4,"shortExplanation":"Expresses 'only', 'nothing but', or 'no other'.","longExplanation":"The grammar point Noun しか～ない is used to emphasize the small quantity or exclusiveness of something. It can be translated as 'only', 'nothing but', or 'no other' in English. It is used with a negative verb to convey the meaning.","formation":"Noun + しか + Negative Verb","examples":[{"jp":"私はリンゴしか食べない。","romaji":"Watashi wa ringo shika tabenai.","en":"I eat only apples.","words":[{"surface":"私","vocabId":"1311110","reading":"わたし"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"リンゴ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しか","vocabId":null},{"surface":"食べない","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべない","baseForm":"食べる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"電車で行くしかないです。","romaji":"Densha de iku shika nai desu.","en":"There is no other way but to go by train.","words":[{"surface":"電車","vocabId":"1443530","reading":"でんしゃ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行く","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく"},{"surface":"しか","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"です","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3]},{"jp":"彼は一冊の本しか持っていない。","romaji":"Kare wa isatsu no hon shika motte inai.","en":"He has only one book.","words":[{"surface":"彼","vocabId":"1483070","reading":"かれ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"一冊","vocabId":"1162680","reading":"いちさつ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"本","vocabId":"1522150","reading":"ほん"},{"surface":"しか","vocabId":null},{"surface":"持っていない","vocabId":"1315720","reading":"もっていない","baseForm":"持つ"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5]},{"jp":"この店にはビールしかない。","romaji":"Kono mise ni wa biiru shika nai.","en":"There is nothing but beer in this store.","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"店","vocabId":"1582120","reading":"みせ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ビール","vocabId":null},{"surface":"しか","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ない","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[5]}],"formalityLevel":"neutral","usageNote":"Paired with a negative verb for emphasis - \"nothing but/only\", stronger than だけ.","family":{"id":"exclusivity","name":"Exclusivity (Only / Nothing But)","relatedPoints":["n5-029","n3-032","n4-012","n2-128","n2-130","n2-116","n3-023","n2-138"],"axis":"constraint"},"kind":"construction"}